---
/** "Why Genbeya?": the name, from lean manufacturing's genba and obeya. */
---

<section class="section name" id="why-genbeya" aria-labelledby="name-title">
  <div class="container">
    <header class="section-head name__head" data-reveal>
      <p class="eyebrow">Why Genbeya?</p>
      <h2 id="name-title">The big room, at the real place</h2>
      <p>The name joins two words from lean manufacturing.</p>
    </header>

    <div class="name__equation">
      <article class="word" data-reveal lang="en">
        <p class="word__kanji" lang="ja">
          <ruby>
            現場<rp>(</rp>
            <rt>genba</rt>
            <rp>)</rp>
          </ruby>
        </p>
        <h3>
          genba <span>— “the real place”</span>
        </h3>
        <p>
          Where value is actually created. Lean's advice is to go to the genba and see for yourself, instead of reading
          reports somewhere else.
        </p>
      </article>

      <span class="name__op" aria-hidden="true">
        +
      </span>

      <article class="word" data-reveal lang="en">
        <p class="word__kanji" lang="ja">
          <ruby>
            大部屋<rp>(</rp>
            <rt>obeya</rt>
            <rp>)</rp>
          </ruby>
        </p>
        <h3>
          obeya <span>— “big room”</span>
        </h3>
        <p>The project room, where plans, tasks, problems and status hang on the walls for everyone to see.</p>
      </article>
    </div>

    <p class="name__result" data-reveal>
      <strong>Genbeya</strong> is the big room at the real place: everything about a project — docs, tasks, decisions,
      code and history — kept right where the work happens, in the repository. Versioned, reviewable, and open to every
      tool and person that can read files.
      <span class="name__say">Say it “gen-BEH-ya”.</span>
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .name__head {
    margin-inline: auto;
    text-align: center;
  }
  .name__head .eyebrow {
    justify-content: center;
  }
  .name__equation {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) auto minmax(0, 1fr);
    align-items: center;
    gap: clamp(1rem, 3vw, 2.5rem);
    max-width: 62rem;
    margin-inline: auto;
  }
  .word {
    height: 100%;
    padding: clamp(1.5rem, 3vw, 2.5rem);
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    border-radius: var(--radius-xl);
    background: radial-gradient(24rem 14rem at 50% 0%, rgb(124 127 242 / 0.1), transparent 70%), var(--surface);
    text-align: center;
  }
  .word__kanji {
    margin: 0 0 1.25rem;
    color: var(--text);
    font-family: var(--font-jp);
    font-size: clamp(3.25rem, 7vw, 5.25rem);
    font-weight: 500;
    line-height: 1.25;
  }
  .word__kanji rt {
    color: var(--accent-text);
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.17em;
    letter-spacing: 0.2em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }
  .word h3 {
    font-size: 1.25rem;
  }
  .word h3 span {
    color: var(--text-2);
    font-weight: 450;
  }
  .word p:last-child {
    margin: 0.75rem auto 0;
    max-width: 24rem;
    color: var(--text-2);
    font-size: 0.9375rem;
  }
  .name__op {
    color: var(--accent-text);
    font-size: 2.5rem;
    font-weight: 300;
  }
  .name__result {
    max-width: 44rem;
    margin: clamp(2.5rem, 5vw, 4rem) auto 0;
    color: var(--text-2);
    font-size: clamp(1.0625rem, 1.5vw, 1.25rem);
    line-height: 1.7;
    text-align: center;
  }
  .name__result strong {
    color: var(--text);
  }
  .name__say {
    display: block;
    margin-top: 1rem;
    color: var(--text-3);
    font-size: 0.875rem;
  }

  @media (max-width: 47.99rem) {
    .name__equation {
      grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr);
    }
    .name__op {
      justify-self: center;
    }
  }
</style>
